cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this user guide, please cite it as below.
title: SciLifeLab Training Webpage Template User Guide
abstract: >-
  A step-by-step guide to the SciLifeLab Training Webpage Template, for
  trainers with no experience of Git, Python or Quarto. It explains how
  to set up, publish and maintain a FAIR website for a training: the
  landing page, training instances, data files, training materials,
  instructor notes, and publishing the training on Zenodo.
